<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="Ship accessible SaaS without slowing down. Everymode enforces WCAG compliance in your CI/CD pipeline." />
  <title>Everymode - Ship Accessible SaaS Without Slowing Down</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Google+Sans:wght@400;500;700&family=Roboto:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Roboto', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #202124;
      background: #ffffff;
    }

    h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
      font-family: 'Google Sans', Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    header {
      padding: 20px 0;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .logo-container {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .logo svg {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
    }

    .logo-text {
      font-family: 'Google Sans', Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 400;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0F9D58 0%, #fbbc04 33%, #ea4335 66%, #4285f4 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }

    nav {
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.3), 0 1px 3px 1px rgba(60,64,67,.15);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .nav-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 12px 24px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #5f6368;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.2s;
      padding: 8px 0;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover,
    .nav-links a[aria-current="page"] {
      color: #4285f4;
    }

    .nav-links a:focus {
      outline: 3px solid #4285f4;
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      background: #4285f4;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 24px;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 14px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.3), 0 2px 6px 2px rgba(60,64,67,.15);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .btn::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: -100%;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, 
        transparent 0%,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3) 50%,
        transparent 100%
      );
      animation: shimmer-slow 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes shimmer-slow {
      0% {
        left: -100%;
      }
      50% {
        left: 100%;
      }
      100% {
        left: 100%;
      }
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background: #5a95f5;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.3), 0 4px 8px 3px rgba(60,64,67,.15);
      transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.05);
    }

    .btn span {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .btn:focus {
      outline: 3px solid #4285f4;
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #202124;
      border: 2px solid #dadce0;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.3);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      border-color: #4285f4;
      color: #1a73e8;
    }

    .btn-secondary::before {
      display: none;
    }

    main {
      padding: 60px 0;
    }

    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 80px 0 100px;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 56px;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0F9D58 0%, #34a853 20%, #fbbc04 40%, #ea4335 60%, #4285f4 80%, #1a73e8 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .hero .subheadline {
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #5f6368;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .cta-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .social-proof {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 80px 0;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }

    .social-proof h2 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ea4335 0%, #fbbc04 50%, #34a853 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .social-proof .intro {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #5f6368;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .stat-card {
      background: white;
      padding: 40px 32px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.3), 0 1px 3px 1px rgba(60,64,67,.15);
      transition: all 0.3s;
      border: 2px solid transparent;
    }

    .stat-card:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.3), 0 2px 6px 2px rgba(60,64,67,.15);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .stat-card:nth-child(1):hover {
      border-color: #ea4335;
    }

    .stat-card:nth-child(2):hover {
      border-color: #f4b400;
    }

    .stat-card:nth-child(3):hover {
      border-color: #0F9D58;
    }

    .stat-card:focus-within {
      outline: 3px solid #4285f4;
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .stat-card .stat-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-family: 'Google Sans', Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .stat-card:nth-child(1) .stat-icon { 
      background: rgba(234, 67, 53, 0.1);
      color: #ea4335;
    }
    .stat-card:nth-child(2) .stat-icon { 
      background: rgba(244, 180, 0, 0.1);
      color: #f4b400;
    }
    .stat-card:nth-child(3) .stat-icon { 
      background: rgba(15, 157, 88, 0.1);
      color: #0F9D58;
    }

    .stat-card .stat-value {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #202124;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-family: 'Google Sans', Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .stat-card .stat-label {
      color: #5f6368;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .stat-card .stat-source {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #80868b;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .solution-callout {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 48px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a73e8 0%, #4285f4 100%);
      color: white;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-top: 48px;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.3), 0 2px 6px 2px rgba(60,64,67,.15);
    }

    .solution-callout h3 {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    }

    .solution-callout p {
      font-size: 16px;
      opacity: 0.95;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .section h2 {
      font-size: 40px;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1a73e8 0%, #4285f4 50%, #34a853 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .section p {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #5f6368;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 32px;
      margin-top: 56px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      padding: 32px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 2px solid #dadce0;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }

    .feature-card:hover {
      border-color: transparent;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.3), 0 2px 6px 2px rgba(60,64,67,.15);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .feature-card:nth-child(1):hover {
      border-color: #4285f4;
    }

    .feature-card:nth-child(2):hover {
      border-color: #ea4335;
    }

    .feature-card:nth-child(3):hover {
      border-color: #f4b400;
    }

    .feature-card:nth-child(4):hover {
      border-color: #0F9D58;
    }

    .feature-card:nth-child(5):hover {
      border-color: #4285f4;
    }

    .feature-card:nth-child(6):hover {
      border-color: #ea4335;
    }

    .feature-card:focus-within {
      outline: 3px solid #4285f4;
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .feature-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .feature-card:nth-child(1) .feature-icon {
      background: rgba(66, 133, 244, 0.15);
      color: #4285f4;
    }

    .feature-card:nth-child(2) .feature-icon {
      background: rgba(234, 67, 53, 0.15);
      color: #ea4335;
    }

    .feature-card:nth-child(3) .feature-icon {
      background: rgba(244, 180, 0, 0.15);
      color: #f4b400;
    }

    .feature-card:nth-child(4) .feature-icon {
      background: rgba(15, 157, 88, 0.15);
      color: #0F9D58;
    }

    .feature-card:nth-child(5) .feature-icon {
      background: rgba(66, 133, 244, 0.15);
      color: #4285f4;
    }

    .feature-card:nth-child(6) .feature-icon {
      background: rgba(234, 67, 53, 0.15);
      color: #ea4335;
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: #202124;
    }

    .feature-card p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #5f6368;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .cta-section {
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a73e8 0%, #4285f4 100%);
      color: white;
      padding: 80px 48px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin: 80px 0;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.3), 0 2px 6px 2px rgba(60,64,67,.15);
    }

    .cta-section h2 {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: white;
      background: none;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: white;
    }

    .cta-section p {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: white;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      font-weight: 300;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }

    .cta-section .btn {
      background: white;
      color: #1a73e8;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.3);
    }

    .cta-section .btn:hover {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      color: #174ea6;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.3), 0 4px 8px 3px rgba(60,64,67,.15);
    }

    .cta-section .btn::before {
      display: none;
    }

    footer {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      color: #5f6368;
      padding: 32px 0;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #dadce0;
    }

    footer p {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 36px;
      }

      .hero .subheadline {
        font-size: 18px;
      }

      .section h2 {
        font-size: 32px;
      }

      .cta-group {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .nav-links {
        gap: 16px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header role="banner" class="container" aria-label="Site header">
    <div class="logo-container">
      <div class="logo">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M 50 10 A 40 40 0 0 1 90 50 L 75 50 A 25 25 0 0 0 50 25 Z" fill="#0F9D58"/>
          <path d="M 10 50 A 40 40 0 0 1 50 10 L 50 25 A 25 25 0 0 0 25 50 Z" fill="#f4b400"/>
          <path d="M 10 50 A 40 40 0 0 0 60 85 L 58 72 A 25 25 0 0 1 25 50 Z" fill="#ea4335"/>
          <path d="M 58 66 L 58 91 L 80 78.5 Z" fill="#ea4335"/>
          <rect x="50" y="45" width="40" height="10" fill="#4285f4"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <span class="logo-text">everymode</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <nav aria-label="Primary navigation" role="navigation">
    <div class="container nav-inner">
      <div class="nav-links" role="list">
        <a href="index.html" role="listitem" aria-current="page">Home</a>
        <a href="behind.html" role="listitem">Behind Everymode</a>
        <a href="how-it-works.html" role="listitem">How It Works</a>
      </div>
      <a class="btn" href="#contact" aria-label="Get early access"><span>Get Early Access</span></a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main role="main">
    <section class="hero container">
      <h1>Ship Accessible SaaS — Without Slowing Down</h1>
      <p class="subheadline">
        Everymode enforces WCAG compliance in your CI/CD pipeline, so you build inclusive products from day one — not after costly audits and rework.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-group">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn" aria-label="See how Everymode works"><span>See How It Works</span></a>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-secondary" aria-label="Get early access to Everymode"><span>Get Early Access</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="social-proof">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>The Accessibility Crisis Facing SaaS Teams</h2>
        <p class="intro">Most products ship inaccessible — leading to lawsuits, costly fixes, and missed opportunities</p>
        
        <div class="stats-grid" id="stats-container">
          <!-- Statistics will be dynamically generated by JavaScript -->
        </div>

        <div class="solution-callout">
          <h3>Everymode eliminates accessibility debt before it starts</h3>
          <p>Automated WCAG enforcement in every commit, sprint, and deploy</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section container">
      <h2>Build Fast. Stay Compliant. Never Compromise.</h2>
      <p>
        Most SaaS teams don't plan for accessibility until it's too late. Retrofitting can consume 50–70% of development time and cost tens of thousands annually in audits and rework.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Everymode changes that.</strong> Our SaaS-first accessibility engine integrates directly into your CI/CD pipeline, automatically flagging and blocking non-compliant code before it ships.
      </p>

      <div class="features-grid" id="features-container">
        <!-- Feature cards will be dynamically generated by JavaScript -->
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container">
      <section class="cta-section">
        <h2 id="contact">Ready to Build Accessible SaaS?</h2>
        <p>Join forward-thinking SaaS teams shipping inclusive products without the burden.</p>
        <div class="cta-group">
          <a href="mailto:hello@everymode.com" class="btn" aria-label="Request a demo"><span>Request a Demo</span></a>
          <a href="how-it-works.html" class="btn btn-secondary" aria-label="Learn more about Everymode"><span>Learn More</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer role="contentinfo">
    <div class="container">
      <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> Everymode. Building accessible software for everyone.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
